P5	S3	object_found → exp
P6	S3	exp → endless
C2	S3	endless	from P4 P5 P6
P7	S4	endless → ¬same_all
C3	S4	¬same_all	from C2 P7
# S5: a practical law is objectively necessary only because it holds for everyone with reason and will
